<html>
<body style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: #222222; line-height: 1.5;">
<p>Dear {!DirectDebitRequest__c.CustomerAccountName__c},</p>

<p>Thank you for setting up a Direct Debit authorisation with Modon. Your authorisation has been
registered with the UAE Direct Debit System and is now <b>awaiting your signature</b>. Until it is
signed, no instalment can be collected from your account.</p>

<table cellpadding="6" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="font-size: 14px; border-collapse: collapse;">
    <tr>
        <td style="color: #666666;">Authorisation reference</td>
        <td><b>{!DirectDebitRequest__c.DDA_Reference_Number__c}</b></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td style="color: #666666;">Request number</td>
        <td>{!DirectDebitRequest__c.Name}</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td style="color: #666666;">Your bank</td>
        <td>{!DirectDebitRequest__c.Customer_Bank_Name__c}</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td style="color: #666666;">Submitted on</td>
        <td>{!DirectDebitRequest__c.Sent_To_Bank_Date__c}</td>
    </tr>
</table>

<p><b>What you need to do</b><br />
Your bank will contact you through its own channels - online banking, its mobile app, or a branch
visit - to have the Direct Debit authorisation signed. Please complete that step at your earliest
convenience.</p>

<p style="color: #a04000;"><b>Please note:</b> an authorisation that is not signed within 7 working
days of submission is cancelled automatically by the UAE Direct Debit System, and a new
authorisation will have to be raised.</p>

<p>If you have already signed, no further action is needed - please allow up to two working days for
your bank to confirm it to us. If you believe this request was raised in error, or you need any help,
please reply to this email or contact your Modon relationship manager.</p>

<p>Kind regards,<br />
<b>Modon</b></p>

<p style="font-size: 11px; color: #888888;">This is an automated message. Please do not share your
bank account credentials, one-time passwords or card details in reply to any email.</p>
</body>
</html>